  (text "One board for both dryers, every part assembled by JLCPCB. The 1-roll BOM leaves off the 2-roll-only parts (field Build)."
    (at 260 330.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8bb531e7-6345-48b9-822b-3a94e42b7968"))
  (text "U1 antenna at the board edge: no copper, parts or traces under it. USB is data only: plug in 12 V while flashing."
    (at 260 336.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b6c9e04a-a842-403f-aef0-36881a8145e7"))
  (text "S1 (U14, C37, J18) and S2 (U15, C39, J19) are small boards on break-off tabs: their nets reach the board only through the harness."
    (at 260 342.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "8a39b029-e447-4949-8879-8a6bf05e390c"))
  (text "U10/U11: 39k/10k on VREF = 1.0 V -> about 0.72 A RMS with 0.11 R sense resistors. Exposed pad to GND with vias."
    (at 260 348.2 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "44a3d18d-9c18-4927-803d-fe9bfae16e76"))
  (text "Heater path TB1 -> TB2 -> Q1 carries 12.5 A: wide pours, 2 oz copper, copper area under Q1."
